    "description": "The Event Ticket Transfer API allows users to manage the transfer of event tickets seamlessly. This operation enables authorized users, such as event organizers and ticketing agents, to update the ownership of purchased tickets to new attendees efficiently. It is particularly useful in scenarios where ticket holders need to hand over tickets to others, ensuring that the process is tracked and secure. By utilizing this API, developers can integrate ticket transfer functionality into their applications, enhancing the user experience for event-goers.",
